    "input": {
      "body": "Hi Bradley,\n\nFollowing the document-workflow article I sent, I wanted to share a short piece on what happens after an AI tool starts saving time.\n\nThe benefit can stay with one person, or become a better process the whole team uses. Making that second step happen is increasingly the focus of our work at Possible Minds.\n\nhttps://getpossibleminds.com/t/IPpGzQkljw\n\nAt The Hayes Law Firm, which seems harder: finding a useful AI tool or turning it into a shared way of working? I'd value your perspective.\n\nBest,\nPranav\nFounder, Possible Minds",
      "subject": "Re: where AI could compound at The Hayes Law Firm, APC",
